ate README.md", "created_at": "2025-02-06T04:16:04Z", "repo": "Double-Exponential-Smoothing", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "15b538a29f8c8aa624e18c51d51c4c86c1133d73", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-03-01T02:34:27Z", "repo": "Stationarity-in-Time-series-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb06267457cd0cd36abfc286ee3c09b6e09c7e96", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2025-03-05T14:18:43Z", "repo": "Forecasting-the-Future-A-Time-Series-Analysis-of-NIFTY-NYSE", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b647b1b5778ad57a69a4bc04b07261d49fac4c5b", "message": "Update R_code_Forecasting The Future.R", "created_at": "2025-03-04T16:02:32Z", "repo": "Forecasting-the-Future-A-Time-Series-Analysis-of-NIFTY-NYSE", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5c282aae477a244bcbd26f730c5ddaa1c54e9d10", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-03-04T16:01:24Z", "repo": "Forecasting-the-Future-A-Time-Series-Analysis-of-NIFTY-NYSE", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5c90ed5ea4acf3d93363ade9b3b3fc6dc35c8005", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-03-04T16:00:16Z", "repo": "Forecasting-the-Future-A-Time-Series-Analysis-of-NIFTY-NYSE", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "61ab14930c3c486c2cc6b41cb025ad1c382f0424", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:18:26Z", "repo": "Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e8dc13b1eafdb3defee3f398109e146f2aa388df", "message": "Delete RFE_Revised_Code.ipynb", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:17:54Z", "repo": "Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "538416ad7f45fb5aee8f66ab1bb7ad2db42e9e96", "message": "Update README.md\n\n# Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data\r\nThis project focuses on building a robust machine learning model for daily precipitation prediction over various grid locations in Madhya Pradesh, India, using data from the ERA5 reanalysis dataset (1979\u20132023). The model is developed using XGBoost, a powerful gradient boosting framework, and incorporates Recursive Feature Elimination (RFE) for selecting the most significant meteorological features that contribute to rainfall prediction.\r\n\r\nHighlights\r\nDataset: Daily ERA5 climate data (1979\u20132023) for multiple spatial grids across Madhya Pradesh.\r\n\r\nModel: XGBRegressor from the XGBoost library is used for regression tasks.\r\n\r\nFeature Selection: RFECV (Recursive Feature Elimination with Cross-Validation) using XGBoost as the base estimator to identify the most relevant predictors.\r\n\r\nGoal: Improve prediction accuracy and model interpretability by reducing dimensionality and focusing on the most influential features.\r\n\r\nMethodology\r\nData Preprocessing: Cleaned and organized daily ERA5 data into a machine learning-ready format.\r\n\r\nFeature Selection: Applied RFE with XGBoost to rank and select the top features contributing to precipitation.\r\n\r\nModel Training: Trained the XGBoost regressor on selected features.\r\n\r\nEvaluation: Evaluated model performance using metrics like R\u00b2 score, RMSE, and MAE.", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:06:26Z", "repo": "Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3a23b0fae1b8e7109889af043335abcadd26644", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nThis script performs daily precipitation prediction for various grid points in Madhya Pradesh\r\nusing the XGBoost regression model. It leverages Recursive Feature Elimination (RFE) with \r\nXGBoost as the base estimator to identify the most important features from the ERA5 dataset \r\n(1979\u20132023). The selected features are then used to train the final predictive model.", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:04:25Z", "repo": "Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b9a4b94e78dcf11294b17b726b65967b5d16ded9", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2025-07-13T06:56:07Z", "repo": "Feature-Selection-in-large-climate-data", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": []}